  "the_quiet_stretch_plans_sections_detai.3570": "The quiet stretch. Plans, sections, details. The rule is no meetings before eleven, and it mostly survives contact with reality.",
  "the_site_studio.42b0": "The site studio",
  "the_space.6752": "The space",
  "the_studio.0705": "The studio",
  "the_studio_began_in_2009_with_one_hous.958d": "The studio began in 2009 with one house and a conviction that has not changed since: a building should be shaped by the life inside it, not the other way round. That first client wanted somewhere to cook, read and have people over — so we designed around a kitchen and let the rest follow.",
  "the_warehouse.364a": "The Warehouse",
  "they_breathed_new_life_into_a_tired_ol.4af3": "They breathed new life into a tired old building without losing an ounce of its character. Genuinely remarkable work.",
  "they_listened_to_how_we_actually_live.06e0": "They listened to how we actually live, then gave us a home that fits us perfectly — every room has a reason to be there.",
  "this_is_architecture_that_reflects_all.2562": "This is architecture that reflects all of you",
  "three_benches_we_could_not_work_withou.3eb2": "Three benches we could not work without.",
  "three_steps_about_two_weeks.52ad": "Three steps, about two weeks.",
  "timber.e5c6": "Timber",
  "timeless.5488": "Timeless.",
  "today_the_practice_is_fourteen_people.ff5e": "Today the practice is fourteen people across two studios, working on everything from a single reimagined room to a whole building brought back into use. No project is too small if the thinking is worth doing.",
  "tomas_alvarez.9d45": "Tomas Alvarez",
  "twelve_metres_of_pinnable_surface_hold.0366": "Twelve metres of pinnable surface holding every live project at once. If a scheme is not on the wall it is not really being designed yet.",
  "two_floors_above_a_foundry_yard_a_draf.67c7": "Two floors above a foundry yard: a drafting hall, a model shop that makes a lot of dust, and a wall of material samples nobody is allowed to tidy. This is the room every project passes through.",
  "two_studios_one_practice.1cd5": "Two studios, one practice.",
  "villas.4e9d": "Villas",
  "virtual_tours.0df7": "Virtual tours",
